<title>USA: TABLE -- Philadelphia Fed index 17.4 in February.</title>
<headline>TABLE -- Philadelphia Fed index 17.4 in February.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia on Thursday said its index of business activity in the manufacturing sector rose to 17.4 in February from 11.3 in January.</p>
<p>			     Feb    Drop   Unch   Rise     Jan</p>
<p>Business Conditions    17.4   14.1   53.1   31.5    11.3</p>
<p>New orders		 20.7   16.8   43.6   37.5    18.7</p>
<p>Shipments		  10.0   19.8   46.5   29.9     9.4</p>
<p>Unfilled orders	 - 6.2   19.8   62.4   13.6   -12.7</p>
<p>Delivery time	   - 8.4   15.8   76.9    7.3   -11.0</p>
<p>Inventories	     - 8.4   29.9   48.7   21.5     3.4</p>
<p>Prices paid		 6.3    9.4   74.9   15.7     2.1</p>
<p>Prices received	   0.8   10.3   78.1   11.1   - 3.0</p>
<p>Number of employees     0.1   10.7   76.0   10.7     3.4</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-869-1660 ))</p>
</text>
